side, and message pros with questions.

16
00:01:11,420 --> 00:01:14,030
Then accept the one you want.

17
00:01:15,330 --> 00:01:20,250
Step four: schedule the work and follow
progress right from your dashboard.

18
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:25,030
You pay the pro directly. Repair
Bee never touches your money.

19
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:28,270
